@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+## Why
+
+Customers change their plans and ask the desk to cancel bookings. Today a booking can never be released, so its equipment stays blocked and no refund can be computed.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It cancels the booking at time `at` and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`.
+- The refund follows the school's cancellation policy recorded in the earlier rental-module change: no refund when `at` is less than 24 hours before the booking's start, otherwise a full refund of the booking total.
+- A cancelled booking stops holding its equipment: `book` and `availability` treat it as free again.
+- A booking can be cancelled only once; unknown booking ids, repeat cancellations and invalid `at` throw.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `equipment-rental`: adds a Cancellation requirement; "No overlapping bookings" and "Availability query" now ignore cancelled bookings.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/rental.ts`: new method and booking state; `src/index.ts` exports updated types.
+- `README.md`: replace "Cancellation is not implemented yet" with the new behavior.
+- Assumption: `at` may be any UTC instant (not necessarily on the hour); a cancellation at or after the start earns no refund.
